  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 580930,
    "RowId": 9667,
    "Dialogue": "I've got my eye on you, Wihuwte...\nYou won't fool us again.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581010,
    "RowId": 9668,
    "Dialogue": "He's using the Endless like pawns!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581062,
    "RowId": 9669,
    "Dialogue": "My countrymen...\nYour memories will carry me onward.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581134,
    "RowId": 9670,
    "Dialogue": "As hard as this is, we must push on.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581186,
    "RowId": 9671,
    "Dialogue": "Memories of fear and terror...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581234,
    "RowId": 9672,
    "Dialogue": "An unconscionable act...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581274,
    "RowId": 9673,
    "Dialogue": "Damn you, Calyx!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581306,
    "RowId": 9674,
    "Dialogue": "We see this to the end.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581346,
    "RowId": 9675,
    "Dialogue": "We've beaten you, Calyx.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581386,
    "RowId": 9676,
    "Dialogue": "We did it!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581414,
    "RowId": 9677,
    "Dialogue": "Is that truly the end of it...?",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581462,
    "RowId": 9678,
    "Dialogue": "Something doesn't feel right...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581510,
    "RowId": 9679,
    "Dialogue": "Now's our chance!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581542,
    "RowId": 9680,
    "Dialogue": "Calyx has nothing left to throw at us.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581598,
    "RowId": 9681,
    "Dialogue": "A primal of all things...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581638,
    "RowId": 9682,
    "Dialogue": "It won't be the same without Geode around...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581698,
    "RowId": 9683,
    "Dialogue": "We have to stand watch over our supplies.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581754,
    "RowId": 9684,
    "Dialogue": "I still can't believe it...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581798,
    "RowId": 9685,
    "Dialogue": "Nothing to report.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581834,
    "RowId": 9686,
    "Dialogue": "I miss Geode...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581866,
    "RowId": 9687,
    "Dialogue": "This gun is going to Genolt.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581910,
    "RowId": 9688,
    "Dialogue": "It's just too much...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581946,
    "RowId": 9689,
    "Dialogue": "Might be time for a break.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 581990,
    "RowId": 9690,
    "Dialogue": "These are the times that test us the most.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582050,
    "RowId": 9691,
    "Dialogue": "I have to submit a requisition form for more parts.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582118,
    "RowId": 9692,
    "Dialogue": "For Geode...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582146,
    "RowId": 9693,
    "Dialogue": "We're developing new high-security arcane circuits.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582214,
    "RowId": 9694,
    "Dialogue": "With these readings, there must be a mother lode underground.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582290,
    "RowId": 9695,
    "Dialogue": "So there's more phainite to be found beneath us...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582358,
    "RowId": 9696,
    "Dialogue": "Ah, to explore is to be alive!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582406,
    "RowId": 9697,
    "Dialogue": "Mech ops always make me nervous...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582458,
    "RowId": 9698,
    "Dialogue": "Leave the handling of the astrodrill to me!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582518,
    "RowId": 9699,
    "Dialogue": "Where's the phainite!?",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582558,
    "RowId": 9700,
    "Dialogue": "Good work!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582586,
    "RowId": 9701,
    "Dialogue": "That pilot wasn't half bad.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582630,
    "RowId": 9702,
    "Dialogue": "Layers upon layers of crystalline glass...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582690,
    "RowId": 9703,
    "Dialogue": "What a curious star, this Phaenna.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582742,
    "RowId": 9704,
    "Dialogue": "I'll operate the mech!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582782,
    "RowId": 9705,
    "Dialogue": "An op in a cavern, eh...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582822,
    "RowId": 9706,
    "Dialogue": "Lower the output a notch. Gently, now!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582878,
    "RowId": 9707,
    "Dialogue": "Such power!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582906,
    "RowId": 9708,
    "Dialogue": "Excellent work out there!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582946,
    "RowId": 9709,
    "Dialogue": "Warp loaders are simply the best!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 582994,
    "RowId": 9710,
    "Dialogue": "Crystal fragments this way, please!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583046,
    "RowId": 9711,
    "Dialogue": "Submit all materials to the field scanner for analysis!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583118,
    "RowId": 9712,
    "Dialogue": "Mech pilots, break down those corrupted crystals!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583182,
    "RowId": 9713,
    "Dialogue": "The hypercarrot cannons are more formidable than I dared dream...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583262,
    "RowId": 9714,
    "Dialogue": "Bring the ash over here!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583302,
    "RowId": 9715,
    "Dialogue": "The field scanner will root out any hidden spongoi!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583370,
    "RowId": 9716,
    "Dialogue": "Mech pilots, crush those irregular spongoi!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583430,
    "RowId": 9717,
    "Dialogue": "These spongoi don't stand a chance against a warp loader going full throttle!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583522,
    "RowId": 9718,
    "Dialogue": "Deliver the phainite here!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583566,
    "RowId": 9719,
    "Dialogue": "The field scanners remain fully operational on this star as well.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583646,
    "RowId": 9720,
    "Dialogue": "Begin mining from a quicksand pit once you have sufficient ionic energy!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583734,
    "RowId": 9721,
    "Dialogue": "Accumulate ionic energy to begin mining!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583790,
    "RowId": 9722,
    "Dialogue": "Bring the glass fragments here!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583838,
    "RowId": 9723,
    "Dialogue": "Find us some glass clusters, field scanners!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583898,
    "RowId": 9724,
    "Dialogue": "Mech pilots, pulverize the large glass clusters!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 583962,
    "RowId": 9725,
    "Dialogue": "Look at the warp loader go!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584006,
    "RowId": 9726,
    "Dialogue": "'Tis crucial to observe the base...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584058,
    "RowId": 9727,
    "Dialogue": "What a spectacle these spectacles make! Ho ho!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584122,
    "RowId": 9728,
    "Dialogue": "Word has it that you've been busy gardenin'.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584182,
    "RowId": 9729,
    "Dialogue": "They're part of the festival, Silvairre. Relax!",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584246,
    "RowId": 9730,
    "Dialogue": "I cannot see a godsdamned thing...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584298,
    "RowId": 9731,
    "Dialogue": "Quite a handsome design, wouldn't you say?",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584358,
    "RowId": 9732,
    "Dialogue": "Aye, a finer pair of glasses, I've never worn.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584422,
    "RowId": 9733,
    "Dialogue": "Treno is safe. And has been, all this time...",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584482,
    "RowId": 9734,
    "Dialogue": "Whatever its flaws, the barrier is keeping the lightning aether at bay.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584570,
    "RowId": 9735,
    "Dialogue": "What of the injured? Are we needed to help heal them?",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584638,
    "RowId": 9736,
    "Dialogue": "No more screams... I wager that's a good sign.",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584702,
    "RowId": 9737,
    "Dialogue": "",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 584718,
    "RowId": 9738,
    "Dialogue": "",
    "Slowly": false
  },
  {
